<title>FINLAND: STOCKMANN APRIL SALES UP 15.8 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>STOCKMANN APRIL SALES UP 15.8 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish retailer Oy Stockmann Ab said in a statement on Wednesday that group sales increased 15.8 percent year-on-year in April to 725.2 million markka.  </p>
<p>In January-April, Stockmann's sales rose 15.2 percent on the year-ago period to 2.65 billion markka, the company said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
